<https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/blob/627b569d82140cacd149dd6fae6485caaeb07e9d#_validate_arguments> <https://repolex.ai/ontology/extracts/tree-sitter/tree-sitter/v0.25/core/text> "def _validate_arguments(self, args, signature, function_name):\n        if signature and signature[-1].get('variadic'):\n            if len(args) < len(signature):\n                raise exceptions.VariadictArityError(\n                    len(signature), len(args), function_name)\n        elif len(args) != len(signature):\n            raise exceptions.ArityError(\n                len(signature), len(args), function_name)\n        return self._type_check(args, signature, function_name)" <https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/blob/627b569d82140cacd149dd6fae6485caaeb07e9d> .
